{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON ITSELF</strong> is a short, fast-paced roguelike boss rush game with action-packed combat. The game mixes the power-up system from <i>Hades</i> and the fast, intense combat of <i>ULTRAKILL</i> into one action-packed experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a psychopathic murderer who has grown numb to killing humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of hell, you slaughter demons, hunt powerful bosses, and carve your name through endless bloodshed, driven by a single goal: to become the new demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>5 weapons</strong>, each with unique power-ups like bleed, attack speed, curse, healing and more. Switch between them to create deadly combos. Some lower defense\u00a0 (sword), some dash, some act as ultimates (axe).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>6\u00a0waves</strong> of deadly bosses. Use weapon combos, dodge, parry, and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007610?t=1773911599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/d1eab1a39d01f928ebc87c1db0244d6387464c1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773911599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/03ea3fa17a04b842d5c9b923fc54b94b1b45eed6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773911599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/03ea3fa17a04b842d5c9b923fc54b94b1b45eed6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773911599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/66f30c3c77ea5509c05c346ad26c664e.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON ITSELF</strong> is a short, fast-paced roguelike boss rush game with action-packed combat. The game mixes the power-up system from <i>Hades</i> and the fast, intense combat of <i>ULTRAKILL</i> into one action-packed experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a psychopathic murderer who has grown numb to killing humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of hell, you slaughter demons, hunt powerful bosses, and carve your name through endless bloodshed, driven by a single goal: to become the new demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/1d13c4943e1b3939962740d9c8f09a01.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>5 weapons</strong>, each with unique power-ups like bleed, attack speed, curse, healing and more. Switch between them to create deadly combos. Some lower defense\u00a0 (sword), some dash, some act as ultimates (axe).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.poster.avif?t=1773911599\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.webm?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/4ef155cdb50a8a4d97cadf7963fecd4a.mp4?t=1773911599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>6\u00a0waves</strong> of deadly bosses. Use weapon combos, dodge, parry, and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Vincent Dgoat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/2726eb90a246330ce1d7ef26cf97ddfe7ef3f438/header.jpg?t=1773911599","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4007610/2098429273/5d00c1f24b81d582e633900992049b8a5bb3ca97/1770469938/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770470923","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4007610/2098429273/5d00c1f24b81d582e633900992049b8a5bb3ca97/1770469938/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770470